        "key": "agathaweb-content-elements-aa8773df-f988-4e53-8cc9-2cc28435b58a",
        "text": "Fayea has her basic page ready! Now she wants to add some detailed descriptions for her lessons. For blocks of text like this, we use the `<p>` tag.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/df9164ce29301e39f1d227630182ecb7-agathaweb-content-elements-panel-1-4eb16d0b-5e20-4a7a-a041-c92ab9fa22fb.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-content-elements-656a0370-39a7-470c-971d-24643491e64f",
        "text": "Next, Fayea wants to list the key moves for a lesson. For unordered lists of items, we use the `<ul>` tag, with each item inside an `<li>` tag.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/49f98c8019a7d4bd4f18ae278bc372eb-agathaweb-content-elements-panel-2-ac2f301e-8221-4d3d-8241-8bc194d61906.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-content-elements-fb944ed9-d362-4234-baf1-0474a6251439",
        "text": "What's a self-defense website without pictures? Fayea wants to show off her techniques! We use the `<img>` tag to embed images on a webpage.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/61464a81327e6327e1a6a109796562cd-agathaweb-content-elements-panel-3-09aa66a6-2f59-47da-a1c3-8ba38c14c0c4.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Explain common HTML tags for adding content like paragraphs (<p>), lists (<ul>, <li>), and images (<img>). Show examples relevant to Fayea's self-defense website, such as describing a lesson or showing a picture of her demonstrating a move."
